n industry by creating virtual building designs and visualizing construction projects before building them. This can be used to identify potential issues before physically building the structure, reducing the cost of re-doing the project. For example, Trimble's SketchUp Viewer allows architects to view 3D models of their designs in real-time, which can provide a more comprehensive understanding of the project.","tokens":[" of"," a"," person"," taking"," medicine"," to"," identify"," the"," medicine","'s"," effects"," on"," the"," body","."," A"," drawback"," of"," using"," AR"," in"," drug"," testing"," is"," that"," it"," may"," not"," be"," entirely"," accurate"," and"," could"," lead"," to"," incorrect"," conclusions",".","\n","\n","4","."," Construction"," industry"," -"," Aug","mented"," reality"," can"," help"," in"," the"," construction"," industry"," by"," creating"," virtual"," building"," designs"," and"," visual","izing"," construction"," projects"," before"," building"," them","."," This"," can"," be"," used"," to"," identify"," potential"," issues"," before"," physically"," building"," the"," structure",","," reducing"," the"," cost"," of"," re","-","doing"," the"," project","."," For"," example",","," Tr","imble","'s"," Sketch","Up"," View","er"," allows"," architects"," to"," view"," 3","D"," models"," of"," their"," designs"," in"," real","-","time",","," which"," can"," provide"," a"," more"," comprehensive"," understanding"," of"," the"," project","."]}]